{"sourceUrl":"https://food.njau.edu.cn/info/1106/4938.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.320381+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://food.njau.edu.cn/info/1106/4938.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进全国高校食品类专业优秀学生的相互交流，加深学生对南京农业大学食品科学与工程学科的了解，为热爱科研、基础扎实、素质全面、德才兼备的优秀应届本科生搭建继续深造和发展的平台，</span></span><span>南京农业大学食品科技学院</span><span><span>拟定于</span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span><span>10日</span></span><span><span>以</span></span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span>线下</span><span><span>形式举办</span></span><span>第十一届</span><span><span>“</span><span>食尚精英</span><span>”</span><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span>学科基本情况</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>南京农业大学坐落于钟灵毓秀、虎踞龙蟠的古都南京，是隶属于国家教育部的全国重点大学、国家</span><span>“</span><span>211</span><span>工程”重点建设大学、“</span><span>985</span><span>优势学科创新平台”和“双一流”建设高校。食品科学与工程学科起源于</span><span>1921 </span><span>年东南大学农产制造门，分别于</span><span>1993</span><span>年和</span><span>1998</span><span>年建成硕士点和博士点，拥有博士学位一级学科授予权、博士后流动站、国家重点（培育）学科、江苏省一级学科重点学科、江苏省优势学科、一级学科博士点和硕士点以及专业学位授权点，在全国学科评估中获评</span><span>A</span><span>类，为学校“农业科学”学科进入全球前</span></span><span>1‱</span><span>作出重要贡献。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span><span>、报名条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>、</span><span><span>国内全日制在读</span>202</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>级本科生，具有食品科学与工程、食品质量与安全、生物工程、化学、微生物学、分子生物学、生物科学与技术、医学等相关学科背景；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>、</span><span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素养，在校期间未受过任何纪律处分，身心健康；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>、</span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，本科前三年综合成绩达到本专业前</span>20%<span>，达到或接近所在高校免试推荐硕士研究生的要求</span></span><span>；</span><span><span>在科研工作或各类学科竞赛中有突出成绩者优先（如已在核心学术期刊上以第一作者发表论文、获得省级及以上竞赛奖项等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span>、</span><span><span>英语六级</span>425<span>分以上或具有其他同等英语水平。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请材料：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年夏令营报名表</span>1<span>份（附件</span><span>1</span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单</span></span><span>扫描</span><span><span>件</span>1<span>份（需</span></span><span>加盖</span><span><span>教务部门</span></span><span>公章</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>英语水平证明</span></span><span>扫描件</span><span>1<span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>个人自荐陈述</span></span><span>电子版</span><span><span>（格式不限）</span>1<span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>其他证明材料</span></span><span>扫描件</span><span><span>（如已发表录用论文、各类获奖或资格证书）各</span>1<span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>报名统计表</span></span><span>电子版</span><span><span>（附件</span>2<span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请时间与材料提交方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>报名材料电子稿</span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日前发送至</span></span><span><span>zmh@njau.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>。（注：邮件名称以</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>学校名称</span><span>-</span><span>报名材料</span><span>”</span><span>命名，</span></span><span>申请材料打包</span><span><span>以</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>学校名称</span><span>-</span><span>专业</span><span>”</span><span>命名。）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五、</span></strong><strong><span><span>录取安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1、</span><span><span>本次夏令营拟招募优秀大学生</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2、</span><span><span>报名材料审核与录取工作将在</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>3</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>结束，录取名单及活动安排将在南京农业大学食品科技学院网站公布并</span></span><span>短信或</span><span><span>电话</span></span><span>通知</span><span><span>学生本人，未入选者不另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><font>六</font><span>、夏令营内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>活动时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日报到，</span><span>10</span><span>日开展活动；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>活动内容：开展滨江校区及食品科技学院实验室参观、学院及科研团队介绍、师生座谈等活动；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>活动方式：线下。学院将为学员提供在宁活动期间的食宿补助。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><font>七</font><span>、联系人及方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联</span> <span>系</span> <span>人：</span></span><span>仲</span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>025-8439</span><span><span>9660</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span><span>zmh@njau.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Q</span> <span>Q</span> <span><span>群：</span></span><span><span>690737824</span><span>，申请同学请进群。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>南京农业大学食品科技学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"09060f17466cf1be45683790e5d32ecc86dee42d8b31d05d991afa353ea99528","textLength":1168,"sourceSha256":"6aab1692b92ca002edc7f76c7fe081f861826ed523185837e89709f182e87ed4","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件一：2025年南京农业大学食品科技学院“食尚精英”全国优秀大学生夏令营报名表.docx","url":"https://food.njau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1403844247&wbfileid=15548651"},{"name":"附件二：2025年南京农业大学食品科技学院“食尚精英”全国优秀大学生夏令营报名统计表.xlsx","url":"https://food.njau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1403844247&wbfilei